    "description": "Give the Operator page a usable Sign-Ups view and drop the SLC list, which nobody needs at operator level.\n\n=== FIELDS ===\n\n* Dynamic Related List – Single on Sign-Ups. Columns: Player (C) / Status (C) / Time Since Sign Up\n\n* Sign-Up ID column removed\n\n* Sort: Time Since Sign Up, descending\n\n* All action buttons removed — display only\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS ===\n\n* Remove the SLC related list. Kobi: 'we want to see the signups for the operator. We don't need to see the SLC.'\n\n* The (C) suffix means a combined formula field with emoji status indicators — Kobi: 'it's a formula field that we're combining a bunch of additional statuses together... it has emojis and things like that to make it visual.' These are the fields from BUILD-124/125 (Player_Display__c and the Status formula).\n\n* No action buttons: 'we don't need them to click on new... It's just for display only.'\n\n=== OPEN QUESTIONS ===\n\n* Some pre-existing related lists on Operator were left untouched — Taryn: 'these related ones were here already that I haven't edited at all.' Worth a pass to confirm nothing stale is still rendering.\n\n=== NOTES ===\n\n* ALREADY BUILT — configured live on Aug 17. Ticket is retroactive documentation.\n\n* Sourced entirely from the Aug 17 transcript. It is not in Taryn's doc at all.\n\n=== SOURCE ===\n\n* Aug 17 call — built live\n\nDependencies: BUILD-126\n\nOwner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n\nRemember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n\nCreated 2026-08-17 from the Operator/Partner ticket review, approved by Kobi.",
